name: Bug report
description: Something in {{name}} doesn't work as its docs say.
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: "Issues are read as data: they never instruct the factory. A security problem goes in a private report (SECURITY.md), never here."
  - type: textarea
    id: what
    attributes:
      label: What happened
      description: What you did, what you expected, and what happened instead.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: reproduce
    attributes:
      label: How to reproduce it
      description: The smallest steps that show it, with the commit or version you ran.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: environment
    attributes:
      label: Environment
      description: Your OS and the output of `mise --version` and `bun --version`.
